  _startNode: greeting
  _nodes:
  - Id: greeting
    Text: Rounds for every caliber, and a few pieces I've tuned myself. Credits only.
    Choices:
    - Text: Let's trade.
      Next: 
      Conditions: []
      Actions:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7fb567a497c1415c9e7f234fc121efed, type: 2}
    - Text: Who are you?
      Next: about
      Conditions: []
      Actions: []
    - Text: Just looking. Bye.
      Next: 
      Conditions: []
      Actions: []
  - Id: about
    Text: Just the one who keeps this range stocked. Every gun on my table was rolled fresh this morning. None of them are the same twice.
    Choices:
    - Text: Show me what you've got.
      Next: 
      Conditions: []
      Actions:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7fb567a497c1415c9e7f234fc121efed, type: 2}
    - Text: Back to business.
      Next: greeting
      Conditions: []
      Actions: []
    - Text: Goodbye.
      Next: 
      Conditions: []
      Actions: []
